  "segments": [
    {
      "s": 0.0,
      "e": 3.34,
      "text": "At 23 years old, to be given a quarter of a million dollars"
    },
    {
      "s": 3.34,
      "e": 5.48,
      "text": "to go build a company and to say no to that"
    },
    {
      "s": 6.08,
      "e": 7.98,
      "text": "is something people have told me"
    },
    {
      "s": 7.98,
      "e": 8.5,
      "text": "and thought you were insane."
    },
    {
      "s": 9.08,
      "e": 10.78,
      "text": "This is Zeng, and in the past few years"
    },
    {
      "s": 10.78,
      "e": 13.38,
      "text": "he's been studying law, acting in an HBO show,"
    },
    {
      "s": 13.72,
      "e": 15.44,
      "text": "working for a little company called Monzo"
    },
    {
      "s": 15.44,
      "e": 19.32,
      "text": "and turned down 250,000 pounds in investor cash,"
    },
    {
      "s": 19.5,
      "e": 21.98,
      "text": "all because he realized he was working on the wrong thing."
    },
    {
      "s": 22.24,
      "e": 24.84,
      "text": "As a British Pakistani, you're in between two identities."
    },
    {
      "s": 25.18,
      "e": 27.46,
      "text": "You are chairing for England in the World Cup,"
    },
    {
      "s": 27.6,
      "e": 29.62,
      "text": "but then at home you're eating biryani, right?"
    },
    {
      "s": 29.62,
      "e": 31.54,
      "text": "So you're living between these two identities"
    },
    {
      "s": 31.54,
      "e": 33.8,
      "text": "and you're in a search for those shared spaces."
    },
    {
      "s": 34.24,
      "e": 35.58,
      "text": "So Zeng and his best friend Habib"
    },
    {
      "s": 35.58,
      "e": 37.72,
      "text": "tried to find a way to help people in their community"
    },
    {
      "s": 37.72,
      "e": 39.92,
      "text": "feel closer to both of their homes."
    },
    {
      "s": 40.44,
      "e": 42.12,
      "text": "Habib told me a story once about how"
    },
    {
      "s": 42.12,
      "e": 43.52,
      "text": "in his local community in Halifax,"
    },
    {
      "s": 43.72,
      "e": 45.58,
      "text": "people used to pull funds together"
    },
    {
      "s": 45.58,
      "e": 47.38,
      "text": "to support each other when they needed it."
    },
    {
      "s": 47.38,
      "e": 49.18,
      "text": "And then we went searching for something like that"
    },
    {
      "s": 49.18,
      "e": 49.84,
      "text": "for South Asia."
    },
    {
      "s": 50.14,
      "e": 52.22,
      "text": "We couldn't find one, so I gave Habib the ring"
    },
    {
      "s": 52.22,
      "e": 53.28,
      "text": "and said, let's build it."
    },
    {
      "s": 53.46,
      "e": 54.9,
      "text": "So together they built SAATH,"
    },
    {
      "s": 55.04,
      "e": 56.6,
      "text": "a community-led fund that kickstarts"
    },
    {
      "s": 56.6,
      "e": 58.92,
      "text": "locally-led projects across South Asia."
    },
    {
      "s": 58.92,
      "e": 61.72,
      "text": "We'd spent five months tinkering with different tools."
    },
    {
      "s": 61.96,
      "e": 65.7,
      "text": "It was about a day or two away from us wanting to launch"
    },
    {
      "s": 66.4,
      "e": 67.8,
      "text": "and we wanted to change a button."
    },
    {
      "s": 68.12,
      "e": 68.86,
      "text": "We couldn't change a button."
    },
    {
      "s": 68.94,
      "e": 70.38,
      "text": "We wanted to change how much money"
    },
    {
      "s": 70.38,
      "e": 71.74,
      "text": "people can contribute when they sign up."
    },
    {
      "s": 71.9,
      "e": 72.7,
      "text": "We couldn't figure that out."
    },
    {
      "s": 72.84,
      "e": 75.16,
      "text": "And it was frustrating because we had such a big vision"
    },
    {
      "s": 75.16,
      "e": 76.06,
      "text": "for what we wanted to do."
    },
    {
      "s": 76.2,
      "e": 78.72,
      "text": "So we're like, Habib, let's try this AI app,"
    },
    {
      "s": 78.84,
      "e": 80.06,
      "text": "build a tool, we'd love a wall."
    },
    {
      "s": 80.24,
      "e": 82.26,
      "text": "I open it up, I just completely ramble."
    },
    {
      "s": 82.38,
      "e": 83.06,
      "text": "I'm like, this is what I want."
    },
    {
      "s": 83.16,
      "e": 83.7,
      "text": "These are the colors."
    },
    {
      "s": 84.0,
      "e": 85.3,
      "text": "This is the platform."
    },
    {
      "s": 85.3,
      "e": 90.0,
      "text": "And then bam, everything I had over here in my head"
    },
    {
      "s": 90.0,
      "e": 91.7,
      "text": "was exactly what popped up on the screen."
    },
    {
      "s": 91.88,
      "e": 94.5,
      "text": "And 24 hours later, we were live and running."
    },
    {
      "s": 94.86,
      "e": 96.44,
      "text": "And with that, SAATH was built."
    },
    {
      "s": 96.64,
      "e": 97.96,
      "text": "An online fund that lets the people"
    },
    {
      "s": 97.96,
      "e": 100.4,
      "text": "who donate the money actually choose where it goes."
    },
    {
      "s": 100.78,
      "e": 102.16,
      "text": "From a girls' football club in Nepal"
    },
    {
      "s": 102.16,
      "e": 103.44,
      "text": "to a craftswoman academy,"
    },
    {
      "s": 103.78,
      "e": 105.32,
      "text": "which turns old clothes into new bags,"
    },
    {
      "s": 105.64,
      "e": 107.26,
      "text": "Zayn isn't just making one-off payments."
    },
    {
      "s": 107.82,
      "e": 110.12,
      "text": "He's helping to fund businesses across South Asia"
    },
    {
      "s": 110.12,
      "e": 112.3,
      "text": "that will sustain themselves for years to come."
    },
    {
      "s": 112.3,
      "e": 116.02,
      "text": "I remember we saw the Football Academy live,"
    },
    {
      "s": 116.62,
      "e": 118.46,
      "text": "people running around a pitch with a shirt"
    },
    {
      "s": 118.46,
      "e": 119.46,
      "text": "which had a logo on it."
    },
    {
      "s": 119.64,
      "e": 121.6,
      "text": "And we're like, we're just two kids behind a laptop"
    },
    {
      "s": 121.6,
      "e": 122.78,
      "text": "and now there's a football academy"
    },
    {
      "s": 122.78,
      "e": 124.56,
      "text": "that exists in a place we've never stepped foot in."
    },
    {
      "s": 124.74,
      "e": 125.62,
      "text": "That was mind-blowing."
    },
    {
      "s": 126.12,
      "e": 127.34,
      "text": "You know, if you have five pounds alone,"
    },
    {
      "s": 127.62,
      "e": 128.46,
      "text": "that can do a tiny bit."
    },
    {
      "s": 128.56,
      "e": 130.98,
      "text": "But if you put thousands of people together,"
    },
    {
      "s": 131.46,
      "e": 132.52,
      "text": "not even just putting in money,"
    },
    {
      "s": 132.6,
      "e": 134.64,
      "text": "but also their resources, their network and everything,"
    },
    {
      "s": 135.1,
      "e": 137.38,
      "text": "you can bring really ambitious ideas to life."
    }
  ]
}
